{
  "name": "conflict-bypass",
  "description": "#17: release, bye and hello cannot clear or bypass an open conflict (§6.5, §8.2). A release (by key or of everything) gives up claims but clears no open error; bye is always allowed and a new hello of the same change by its own agent gets the open errors redelivered; a hello naming a change another agent created (explicit or the guessable default <agent>/<task>) is 403 forbidden and appends nothing. The commit gate refuses after each, and only an accepted edit touching the key reopens it.",
